  "description": "Certificate of Lawfulness for the existing use of the building's first and second floors as two self-contained two-bedroom flats (Class C3).  ",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "actual_completion_date": "10/07/2025",
  "id": "Hounslow-P_2025_0657",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that on 03 March 2025 the use of the building's first and second floors as two two-bedroom flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.  \r\n\r\nThe applicant has submitted sufficient evidence to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the building's first and second floors had been in continuous use as two self-contained dwellings (Class C3) since at least 03 March 2021 (four years prior to the validation date of this Certificate of Lawfulness Application) and that continued use to this effect would be lawful.  "
  ],
